        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nMAMMAL PHYLOGENY:\n  AMNIOTA\n   |\n   +-- SYNAPSIDA (your lineage!)\n   |    |\n   |    +-- Pelycosaurs (stem)\n   |    +-- Therapsids\n   |    +-- Cynodonts\n   |    +-- MAMMALIA\n   |         |\n   |         +-- Monotremata (egg-laying) — 5 sp\n   |         +-- Marsupialia (pouch)      — ~350 sp\n   |         +-- Placentalia (placenta)   — ~5,500 sp\n   |\n   +-- REPTILIA (previous file)"
    },
