        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "MAMMAL FEATURES:\n  Hair/fur (diagnostic — present in all, even whales briefly)\n  Endothermy (warm-blooded — maintain constant body temperature)\n  Mammary glands (nurse young on milk)\n  Three middle ear bones (malleus + incus + stapes)\n  Diphyodonty (two sets of teeth: deciduous + permanent)\n  Heterodont teeth (incisors, canines, premolars, molars)\n  Single bone in lower jaw (dentary only)\n```"
